concept:australian-border-force-act-2015-sec-11 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "11 Appointment"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-11 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Australian Border Force Commissioner is to be appointed by the Governor-General by written instrument.  (2) The Australian Border Force Commissioner is to be appointed on a full-time basis. Comptroller-General of Customs  (3) While a person holds office as the Australian Border Force Commissioner the person is also the Comptroller-General of Customs. Note: Many Commonwealth laws confer functions and powers on the Comptroller-General of Customs." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Australian Border Force Commissioner is to be appointed by the Governor-General by written instrument.  (2) The Australian Border Force Commissioner is to be appointed on a full-time basis. Comptroller-General of Customs  (3) While a person holds office as the Australian Border Force Commissioner the person is also the Comptroller-General of Customs. Note: Many Commonwealth laws confer functions and powers on the Comptroller-General of Customs."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e813568701abe784eaedadf8bd570ba6b8add514d2dd467b0b737309aa55b06a" ;
    cof:pageNumber "18"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-border-force-act-2015-sec-11-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-border-force-act-2015-sec-11-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-border-force-act-2015-sec-11-ss-3 ;
