concept:australian-border-force-act-2015-sec-13 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "13 Oath or affirmation by Australian Border Force Commissioner"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-13 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Australian Border Force Commissioner must, before beginning to discharge the duties of his or her office, make and subscribe an oath or affirmation in accordance with the form prescribed by the rules for the purposes of this subsection.  (2) The Australian Border Force Commissioner must make and subscribe the oath or affirmation before the Minister.   Australian Border Force Commissioner  Part 2 Appointment of the Australian Border Force Commissioner  Division 3  Section 14  Australian Border Force Act 2015  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  Compliance  (3) The Australian Border Force Commissioner must not engage in conduct that is inconsistent with an oath or affirmation he or she has made and subscribed under this section." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Australian Border Force Commissioner must, before beginning to discharge the duties of his or her office, make and subscribe an oath or affirmation in accordance with the form prescribed by the rules for the purposes of this subsection.  (2) The Australian Border Force Commissioner must make and subscribe the oath or affirmation before the Minister.   Australian Border Force Commissioner  Part 2 Appointment of the Australian Border Force Commissioner  Division 3  Section 14  Australian Border Force Act 2015  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  Compliance  (3) The Australian Border Force Commissioner must not engage in conduct that is inconsistent with an oath or affirmation he or she has made and subscribed under this section."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d9c2174f08c9db365f916e3f45cda26f588cbae07f45d91bc8ea0cb91ad84d75" ;
