concept:australian-border-force-act-2015-sec-20 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20 Resignation of appointment"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-20 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Australian Border Force Commissioner may resign his or her appointment by giving the Governor-General a written resignation.  (2) The resignation takes effect on the day it is received by the Governor-General or, if a later day is specified in the resignation, on that later day." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Australian Border Force Commissioner may resign his or her appointment by giving the Governor-General a written resignation.  (2) The resignation takes effect on the day it is received by the Governor-General or, if a later day is specified in the resignation, on that later day."@en ;
