concept:australian-border-force-act-2015-sec-22 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "22 Other terms and conditions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-22 ;
    values:originalText "The Australian Border Force Commissioner holds office on the terms and conditions (if any) in relation to matters not covered by this Act that are determined by the Minister.   Australian Border Force Commissioner  Part 2 Ministerial directions  Division 5  Section 23  Australian Border Force Act 2015  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
    skos:definition "The Australian Border Force Commissioner holds office on the terms and conditions (if any) in relation to matters not covered by this Act that are determined by the Minister.   Australian Border Force Commissioner  Part 2 Ministerial directions  Division 5  Section 23  Australian Border Force Act 2015  Compilation date: 04/06/2026"@en ;
