concept:australian-border-force-act-2015-sec-34-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "34(3) Alcohol screening test—suspicion that Immigration and Border"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-34-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) If the result of the alcohol screening test shows that alcohol is not present in the worker’s breath, he or she may return to his or her duties immediately.   Alcohol and drug tests  Part 5  Section 35  Australian Border Force Act 2015  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  Relationship with section 35" ;
    skos:definition "(3) If the result of the alcohol screening test shows that alcohol is not present in the worker’s breath, he or she may return to his or her duties immediately.   Alcohol and drug tests  Part 5  Section 35  Australian Border Force Act 2015  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  Relationship with section 35"@en ;
