doc:sec-36-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "36(4) Alcohol screening, breath or blood test or prohibited drug test—" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) A direction under subsection (1) must be given as soon as practicable after the incident concerned and may be given whether or not the worker is still performing his or her duties as an Immigration and Border Protection worker. Provision of blood or body sample while in hospital" ;
    cof:pageNumber "38"^^xsd:integer .

concept:australian-border-force-act-2015-sec-36-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "36(5) Alcohol screening, breath or blood test or prohibited drug test—"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-36-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) If:  (a) an Immigration and Border Protection worker is involved in an incident referred to in subsection (2) or (3); and  (b) the worker attends or is admitted to a hospital for examination or treatment because of the incident; an authorised person may give the worker a written direction requiring the worker to do either or both of the following:  (c) provide a sample of his or her blood for the purpose of an alcohol blood test;  (d) provide a body sample of a kind specified in the direction for a prohibited drug test." ;
    skos:definition "(5) If:  (a) an Immigration and Border Protection worker is involved in an incident referred to in subsection (2) or (3); and  (b) the worker attends or is admitted to a hospital for examination or treatment because of the incident; an authorised person may give the worker a written direction requiring the worker to do either or both of the following:  (c) provide a sample of his or her blood for the purpose of an alcohol blood test;  (d) provide a body sample of a kind specified in the direction for a prohibited drug test."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f4207a4f9558aec8dab316266b62241e9a2478c45d1ea48fcd50c93292a4603e" ;
    values:partOf concept:australian-border-force-act-2015-sec-36 ;
    cof:pageNumber "38"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Worker must provide blood sample for alcohol test or prohibited drug test upon request." ;
    dc:description "yes" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
