concept:australian-border-force-act-2015-sec-38 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "38 Conduct of tests and provision of samples to be in accordance"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-38 ;
    values:originalText "with the rules Conduct of tests  (1) An alcohol screening test, alcohol breath test, alcohol blood test or prohibited drug test under section 34, 35 or 36 is to be conducted in accordance with the rules. Provision of samples  (2) A sample of blood for the purpose of an alcohol blood test under section 35 or 36, or a body sample for the purpose of a prohibited   Alcohol and drug tests  Part 5  Section 39  Australian Border Force Act 2015  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  drug test under that section, is to be provided in accordance with the rules." ;
