concept:australian-border-force-act-2015-sec-54-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "54(6) Delegation by Comptroller-General of Customs"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-54-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) A function that is performed or a power that is exercised by an Immigration and Border Protection worker under a delegation under subsection (3) is taken, for the purposes of the law referred to in subsection (1), to have been performed or exercised by the Comptroller-General of Customs." ;
    skos:definition "(6) A function that is performed or a power that is exercised by an Immigration and Border Protection worker under a delegation under subsection (3) is taken, for the purposes of the law referred to in subsection (1), to have been performed or exercised by the Comptroller-General of Customs."@en ;
