concept:australian-border-force-act-2015-sec-55-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "55(5) Directions by Secretary—administration and control of the"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-55-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) Without limiting subsection (1), directions under that subsection may relate to the reporting by Immigration and Border Protection workers of the following:  (a) serious misconduct by such a worker;   Other matters  Part 7  Section 55  Australian Border Force Act 2015  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (b) criminal activity involving such a worker; where the serious misconduct or criminal activity affects, or is likely to affect, the operations, responsibilities or reputation of the Department. Relationship with directions under section 26" ;
