concept:australian-border-force-act-2015-sec-55-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "55(7) Directions by Secretary—administration and control of the"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-55-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) An Immigration and Border Protection worker must comply with a direction under this section. Note 1: See subsection 13(4) and sections 15, 28 and 29 of the Public Service Act 1999 for the consequences of an APS employee in the Department not complying with subsection (7) of this section. Note 2: See section 57 of this Act for the termination of a person’s engagement as a consultant or contractor, or for the arranging of a person to cease to perform services for the Department, if the person does not comply with subsection (7) of this section. Directions are not legislative instruments" ;
    skos:definition "(7) An Immigration and Border Protection worker must comply with a direction under this section. Note 1: See subsection 13(4) and sections 15, 28 and 29 of the Public Service Act 1999 for the consequences of an APS employee in the Department not complying with subsection (7) of this section. Note 2: See section 57 of this Act for the termination of a person’s engagement as a consultant or contractor, or for the arranging of a person to cease to perform services for the Department, if the person does not comply with subsection (7) of this section. Directions are not legislative instruments"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f356654b46e7165ea8c6aad317571b6daaccc92a4e980c1a4784c2b49eb5181e" ;
    values:partOf concept:australian-border-force-act-2015-sec-55 ;
    cof:pageNumber "56"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Must comply with a direction under this section." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
